OL,3,GNEWSAFormer airport set to be taken    
OL,4,Aover in #4.4m plan                     
OL,6,FCouncil bosses are set to take back    
OL,7,Fcontrol of a former airport site, 15   
OL,8,Fyears after it shut.                   
OL,10,FPlymouth City Airport closed in        
OL,11,FDecember 2011 after operators Sutton   
OL,12,FHarbour Group (SHG) said it was no     
OL,13,Flonger viable.                         
OL,15,FPlymouth City Council confirmed it is  
OL,16,Facquiring the long leasehold interest  
OL,17,Fof the 95-acre site from Plymouth City 
OL,18,FAirport Ltd, a subsidiary of SHG, for  
OL,19,Fjust under #4.4m.                      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
