OL,3,GNEWSAFormer airport set to be taken    
OL,4,Aover in #4.4m plan                     
OL,6,FThe authority said it would also       
OL,7,Facquire a 15-acre adjacent parcel of   
OL,8,Ffreehold-owned land in the north of the
OL,9,Fcity from the same company for about   
OL,10,F#2.6m.                                 
